    {
      "id": "17c25d11-c889-431a-a4ae-87e3b765e794",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "7957d8ef-62fa-495e-a348-96d8721a73bb",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Rivet: The\nmeasured safe\nservice limit is\nFOUR. SIX is a\nbrief test",
                "ceiling, not a\nnormal setting.\nEIGHT is a damage\nwarning. We set\nthe",
                "regulator for\nservice, then\nverify the gauge.\nBigger is not a\nplan",
                "just because it\nfits on a sign."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2fce22fe-b418-4a36-ac4c-e8e7b5eacd9e",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "2bcaf0ab-d753-402d-abd8-bd1d196536da",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "The first service\nplan has four\npressure units\navailable within\nthe",
                "safe limit. The\nclinic needs two,\nthe depot needs\none, and the",
                "foundry needs one.\nA decorative steam\narch would take\nanother two.",
                "The arch is\noptional; the\nthree working\nstops are not. Pip\nadmits he",
                "drew the arch\nbefore adding the\ndemand numbers.\nRivet hands him an",
                "eraser without\ncommenting on its\nimpressive curve."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "10f5d2ce-9665-42c7-a79b-a81d05cce54e",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "0287a6c5-aa3d-406d-ab8d-f1f18750e393",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Dot checks the\nbucket record\nagainst the\nturbine plate.\nFOUR remains",
                "the safe service\nlimit. She signs\nthe card and asks\nRivet to witness",
                "it. Slush watches\nthe two signatures\nand asks where to\nput his. Dot",
                "gives him the copy\nreceipt."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1d807ce5-9f15-46fb-a242-4682c13c8ec8",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 3
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "367eb6c8-f3e6-45c4-af69-28929823d83e",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Choose the normal\nservice setting\nfrom the signed\nengineering",
                "record."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "752d5f2c-ac4b-422c-a16c-7981a33fbef7",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 4
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "a4996bfa-71cc-4b14-ae1c-857d62b7914e",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Which launch plan\nserves every\nrequired stop\nwithout exceeding\nthe",
                "measured limit?\nThe choice of\nfuture emphasis\ndoes not add\npressure",
                "today. Slush\noffers to buy\nbrighter paint for\nthe arch instead.\nYou",
                "must decide\nwhether it can run\nnow, not whether\nit would\nphotograph",
                "well or whether\nsomeone can afford\nits construction."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "080bdbda-d1f4-4084-a8a7-6f7775476141",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 5
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "5a63ed94-4629-4069-aeda-aca1e797944c",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Rivet shows\nseparate branch\nvalves. A blocked\ndistrict can be",
                "isolated while the\nothers keep\nservice. The\nbypass does not\ncreate",
                "more heat. It\ngives the crew a\nway to make a\nrepair without\nmaking",
                "the whole city\nwait outside."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    }
  ]
